   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Describir una carga emocional",
    "@en": "Describe an emotional burden"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**En påkjenning** es una experiencia o carga que exige mucho esfuerzo. **Selvfølelse** es la valoración que una persona tiene de sí misma.",
     "@en": "**En påkjenning** is an experience or burden that requires a lot of effort. **Selvfølelse** is the assessment a person has of himself."
    },
    {
     "@es": "**Å sette grenser** es poner límites; **å håndtere** es afrontar o manejar algo.",
     "@en": "**Å sette grenser** is to set limits; **å håndtere** is to face or handle something."
    }
   ]
  },
